#: app/data/io.github.c9dev.PenguinMail.desktop:5
msgid "Mail and calendar for Linux"
msgstr "Mail and calendar for Linux"

#: app/data/io.github.c9dev.PenguinMail.desktop:10
msgid "mail;email;gmail;imap;inbox;calendar;contacts;"
msgstr "mail;email;gmail;imap;inbox;calendar;contacts;"

#: app/data/io.github.c9dev.PenguinMail.metainfo.xml:15
msgid "Penguin Mail reads Gmail accounts and any IMAP and SMTP account, such as Fastmail, iCloud and Yahoo, and finds the server settings for you. It syncs from the system tray, shows your accounts in one inbox or one at a time, and keeps your mail on your own computer."
msgstr "Penguin Mail reads Gmail accounts and any IMAP and SMTP account, such as Fastmail, iCloud and Yahoo, and finds the server settings for you. It syncs from the system tray, shows your accounts in one inbox or one at a time, and keeps your mail on your own computer."

#: app/data/io.github.c9dev.PenguinMail.metainfo.xml:22
msgid "One inbox for every account, with Gmail's categories, labels and search"
msgstr "One inbox for every account, with Gmail's categories, labels and search"

#: app/data/io.github.c9dev.PenguinMail.metainfo.xml:23
msgid "A calendar with Google Calendar: Day, Week, Month and Agenda views, invitations answered in the mail, and reminders"
msgstr "A calendar with Google Calendar: Day, Week, Month and Agenda views, invitations answered in the mail, and reminders"

#: app/data/io.github.c9dev.PenguinMail.metainfo.xml:25
msgid "A composer that shows formatting as you write, with Undo Send and Send Later"
msgstr "A composer that shows formatting as you write, with Undo Send and Send Later"

#: app/data/io.github.c9dev.PenguinMail.metainfo.xml:26
msgid "Flags in seven colors, VIPs, smart mailboxes and reminders"
msgstr "Flags in seven colours, VIPs, smart mailboxes and reminders"

#: app/data/io.github.c9dev.PenguinMail.metainfo.xml:27
msgid "Gmail's rules, automatic replies and plus addresses, changed from the app"
msgstr "Gmail's rules, automatic replies and plus addresses, changed from the app"

#: app/data/io.github.c9dev.PenguinMail.metainfo.xml:28
msgid "OpenPGP and S/MIME signing and encryption through your own GnuPG"
msgstr "OpenPGP and S/MIME signing and encryption through your own GnuPG"

#: app/data/io.github.c9dev.PenguinMail.metainfo.xml:29
msgid "Remote images blocked until you ask for them"
msgstr "Remote images blocked until you ask for them"

#: app/data/io.github.c9dev.PenguinMail.metainfo.xml:30
msgid "An assistant that runs on a local model or on Claude, off until you pick one"
msgstr "An assistant that runs on a local model or on Claude, off until you pick one"

#: app/data/io.github.c9dev.PenguinMail.metainfo.xml:32
msgid "Adding a Gmail account takes one sign-in with Google in your browser. Penguin Mail is built with GTK and libadwaita and fits best on GNOME, but it runs on any Linux desktop."
msgstr "Adding a Gmail account takes one sign-in with Google in your browser. Penguin Mail is built with GTK and libadwaita and fits best on GNOME, but it runs on any Linux desktop."

